<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2404] TcpDiscoverySpi.setLocalPortRange set  0 doesn&apos;t work</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2404</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Local port range set to 0 presently doesn&apos;t work at least for TcpCommunicationSpi and TcpDiscoverySpi. However SPIs support it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In my understanding the condition has to changed to the following one (from &amp;lt; to &amp;lt;=).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;x = port; x &amp;lt;= port + range&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12932399">IGNITE-2404</key>
            <summary>TcpDiscoverySpi.setLocalPortRange set  0 doesn&apos;t work</summary>
